  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Implementing IHP-IX Strategic and Operational Plans in Alignment with the LAS Strategy for Water Security.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This element will support Arab Member States in the implementation of IHP-IX in Arab Region, through a alignment of the IHP-IX Strategic and Operational Implementation Plans with UNESCO Cairo Mandate as liaison with the League of Arab States, and in particular with the Arab Strategy for Water Security and the Decisions of the Arab Ministerial Council on Water. Focus for the Biennia will be on facilitating IHP governance, policy support including on (1) scientific research and innovation, (2) water education in Fourth Industrial Revolution including sustainability, (3) bridging the data-knowledge gap, integrated water resources management under conditions hyper-aridity in particular groundwater resources, desalination, wastewater treatment, and water governance based on science for mitigation, adaptation, and resilience including AI.</narrative>
  </description>
